## Out of scope (deliberately deferred)

- **Issue #3** — full transcript-bound HKDF
  (`handshake_secret = HKDF-Extract(transcript_hash, SS)`, then
  `HKDF-Expand` for c2s/s2c/IVs/finished keys).  That is a much
  bigger restructuring of the derivation; this plan only adds the
  version/suite tag to the info string.  Issue #3 supersedes this
  plan when implemented; until then this plan is the cheap win.
- **Issue #4** — Finished MAC keys.  Would need their own info
  strings derived from `handshake_secret`, which depends on issue
  #3's derivation tree.
